  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono grill to medium high heat.",
    "Season the fish fillets with cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the grill with olive oil and cook the fish for 4 minutes per side.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked rice, chopped onion, and minced garlic.",
    "Add the cooked fish to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Squeeze the lemon juice over the top of the rice mixture and stir again.",
    "Transfer the rice mixture to the raclette grill vessel.",
    "Cook for an additional 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the rice is dense and jammy.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
